	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "MYOUNG BH-18650-A6AJ012 single-cell 18650 holder, THM horizontal, DIP 90deg type, open frame. LCSC C19184084. Land pattern per MYOUNG drawing MY-CP-0373 rev A/0 (2023-09-01) 'PCB Layout Diagram' (TOP view): terminals at 71.45 +/-0.7 mm pitch, P (+) 35.8 mm and N (-) 35.65 mm from the post centre; 2-dia3.3 snap-post holes at (+27.6,-8) and (-27.6,+8); dia2.4 key-peg hole at (+35.8,+8), beside the + terminal. Body 77 +/-0.5 x 20.7 +/-0.5 mm, housing height 14.9 +/-0.5 mm (the Keystone 1042/1043 outline). Housing PA46 UL94 V-0; terminals SUS304 0.35 mm, Ni-plated. Dielectric 500 VAC 1 min, -25 to +85 C. NOT polarized mechanically.\nTerminal slots 1.6 x 2.6 mm (drawing: 1.3 x 2.6) so they also take the LCSC 3D model's terminals, which sit at +/-36.1 mm; pads 2.8 x 3.6 mm (0.6/0.5 mm ring) because a battery holder takes cell-insertion force. Post and key holes are NPTH (LCSC's library made them plated with zero ring). The LCSC 3D model's posts reach 3.43 mm below the housing, so on a 1.6 mm board their snap heads stand ~1.8 mm proud of the far side: keep that side clear around both posts. The key peg is 1.57 mm long and does not come through. Origin = post centre = 3D model origin. Courtyard = max material (77.5 x 21.2) + 0.25 mm.")
	(tags "battery holder 18650 THM through-hole open frame MYOUNG BH-18650-A6AJ012 C19184084 Keystone 1043")
